      "originalText": "day 12: Project with api call:=\nToday i learnt how to call the api using \naxios. First I created Components navbar.jsx, \ncart.jsx, and productCard.jsx and for context api\ni created context folder inside i created MyContext.jsx\ncomponent then i create MyStore using createContext()\nand higher order function component for provider\nthen inside the contextProvider I  return the\nMyStroe.provider inside pass {children} \n. then I wrap app.jsx using contextProvider.\nthen I created this state inside the context provider\n  const [data, setData] = useState([]);\n  const [page, setPage] = useState(\"productPage\");\n  const [cartItem, setCartItem] = useState([]);\nand pass the value={ {...} } as a props and \ndestructre in navbar, cart, and productCard\ncomponente using useContext(MyStore).\nfor api call I used axios and I gave api from\nhttps://dummyjson.com/products\nof 30 items. and set this api res in setData state\nafter that I used map function on data state and pass data \ninside the productCard as a props. and on \nproductCard show all product details on ui. \nI showed product image, category, title, description,\nrating, reviews, price, also each card i added add to card button\nfor adding perticular item into the card \nalso when clicked on add to cart button then \nadd to cart button hide and show item for \nincrement and decrement. also same thing reflect about item cart on cart.jsx page\non cart.jsx page when cart item added then on \ncart page show all card that added and quantity of \nitem and we increment and decrement item quantity\nalso we delete cart item from cart section. \nalso on cart.jsx page show how many cart in cart page\nand showing all cart item total price on cart page in order summery \nsection\nalso I used advance logins when on cart item quantity\nincrease then click on + sign then imeditely show \n+1 high value immeditely ans for decrement the item quantity\nthen is - sign for decrement also. when number reach 0 then\nautomatically cart item remove from cart section\nalso on productCard.jsx page mean home page there also we\ncan increase and decrease item quantity also when \nitem reach 0 number then automatically show add to\ncart button and hide increment and decrement button. \nit's all about my today learning. If i wrote any wrong word or wrong thing correct it. \n \n\n\n",
